DECISIONS = [
 ("T1489","业务服务停用","Business Service Stop","medium","NJT-0185",
  "服务停止符合 Impact，但停止业务服务、防御工具和恢复服务的直接对象不同。Niji 将父级适配为攻击者借服务接受的正常控制路径有序停止业务功能，使恶意中断与批准维护共享状态终态。Prestige 证明实际使用，Windows 文档证明痕迹等价；来源未证明伪装动机，故置信度为中等且不设 NJS。",
  "Service stopping is Impact, but business services, defensive tools, and recovery services have different direct objects. Niji adapts the parent to an adversary orderly stopping a business function through the service's accepted control path so malicious interruption shares its terminal state with approved maintenance. Prestige establishes actual use and Windows documentation establishes trace equivalence; the sources do not prove camouflage motive, so confidence is medium and no NJS is defined.",
  "正式范围只含具有正常控制路径与业务不可用结果的业务服务停止。安全工具停止归 NJT-0123，恢复服务停止归 T1490，整机关机或重启归 T1529；后继加密与销毁分别保留 NJT-0157/NJT-0156。",
  "Formal scope includes business-service stopping with an ordinary control path and business-unavailability outcome. Security-tool stopping belongs to NJT-0123, recovery-service stopping to T1490, and whole-system shutdown or reboot to T1529; later encryption and destruction remain NJT-0157 and NJT-0156.",["REF-000864","REF-000865","REF-000866","REF-000867","REF-000336"]),
 ("T1490","抑制系统恢复","Inhibit System Recovery","high","NJT-0186",
  "攻击者删除或削弱恢复点、备份、恢复配置和依赖，使组织在事件后无法按预期恢复，明确属于 Impact。Niji 将父级适配为恢复平面先于生产故障失去能力的观察差异，并正式保留一个中等置信的策略驱动延迟到期子项；该子项由 AWS 生命周期语义与防御指导支持，不制造命名受害案例。",
  "Adversary deletion or impairment of recovery points, backups, recovery configuration, and dependencies denies expected post-incident recovery and clearly serves Impact. Niji adapts the parent to the observation difference where the recovery plane loses capability before production fails and retains one medium-confidence policy-driven deferred-expiry child. AWS lifecycle semantics and defensive guidance support the child without inventing a named victim case.",
  "直接当前数据删除和加密归 NJT-0156/NJT-0157；只有恢复职责对象或依赖受损才属于本候选。策略写入须与后来恢复点到期、删除和 RPO 结果相连。",
  "Direct current-data deletion and encryption belong to NJT-0156 and NJT-0157. This candidate requires damage to an object or dependency with a recovery role. A policy write must join later recovery-point expiry, deletion, and RPO outcome.",["REF-000872","REF-000873","REF-000874","REF-000875","REF-000876","REF-000878","REF-000879","REF-000881"]),
 ("T1491","篡改展示内容","Defacement","high","NJT-0187",
  "攻击者让组织控制的网站、入口、登录消息或其他面向人的界面呈现未经授权内容，直接损害展示完整性和受众信任。Niji 把直接对象固定为组织身份下的实际展示结果，并以 Hushmail 事件支持一个展示源绑定替换子项；ATT&CK 的内部/外部子项仅为位置维度，不导入。",
  "An adversary causes an organization-controlled website, portal, login message, or other human-facing interface to present unauthorized content, directly harming display integrity and audience trust. Niji fixes the direct object as actual output under the organization identity and uses the Hushmail incident to support one Display-Source Binding Substitution child. ATT&CK internal and external children are location dimensions and are not imported.",
  "业务数据值变化影响流程或决策归 T1565；钓鱼页、C2 内容、Web shell 或站点入侵若没有组织身份下的可见篡改结果，不满足本技术。",
  "Business-data value changes affecting process or decision belong to T1565. Phishing pages, C2 content, web shells, or site compromise without a visible defacement result under the organization identity do not satisfy this technique.",["REF-000882","REF-000883","REF-000884","REF-000885"]),
 ("T1495","观察链坍塌型固件破坏","Observation-Collapsing Firmware Corruption","medium","NJT-0188",
  "未授权覆写或损坏硬件消费的固件，使设备不能初始化、启动或继续提供功能，明确产生 Impact。Niji 将范围收窄为破坏同时让 OS、agent 或常规固件读回无法报告变化后根因的情形；停机明显，但根因观察链坍塌。CIH 与 NIST 支持因果效果，未证明攻击者以 concealment 为动机，故保持中等置信且不设 NJS。",
  "Unauthorized overwrite or damage to hardware-consumed firmware prevents initialization, boot, or continued function and clearly produces Impact. Niji narrows the scope to corruption that also prevents the OS, agent, or ordinary firmware readback from reporting the post-change root cause. The outage is conspicuous while the root-cause observation chain collapses. CIH and NIST support the causal effect but not a concealment motive, so confidence remains medium and no NJS is defined.",
  "能运行的 pre-OS 植入、继续服务的网络设备修改映像、完成的受限启动和磁盘结构擦除保留既有 owner；合法可回滚更新失败是反例。",
  "Functional pre-OS implants, modified network-device images that keep serving, completed restricted boot, and disk-structure wiping retain their existing owners. A legitimate recoverable update failure is a counterexample.",["REF-000891","REF-000892","REF-000194","REF-000893","REF-000894","REF-000898"]),
 ("T1496","资源劫持","Resource Hijacking","high","NJT-0189",
  "攻击者未经授权消耗受害方计算、网络、消息或托管服务资源完成自身任务，并把费用、配额或容量影响留给受害方，明确属于 Impact。Niji 按观察变量适配为活动反馈控制消费时间包络，以及由提供方执行和计量的消费；资源类型与变现方式仅作 ATT&CK 广度参考。",
  "An adversary consumes victim compute, network, messaging, or managed-service resources without authorization for an adversary task and leaves cost, quota, or capacity impact with the victim, clearly serving Impact. Niji adapts by observation variables: activity feedback controlling the consumption envelope and consumption executed and metered by a provider. Resource type and monetization are ATT&CK breadth context only.",
  "必须证明实际资源计量或服务交易；执行、凭据、C2 和持久化为相邻对象。低覆盖区域归 NJT-0121，竞争驻留清除归 NJT-0091，直接拒绝服务和金融盗窃保持独立。",
  "Actual resource metering or service transactions must be established; execution, credentials, C2, and persistence are adjacent objects. Low-coverage Region placement belongs to NJT-0121, competing-foothold eviction to NJT-0091, and direct denial of service and financial theft remain separate.",["REF-000899","REF-000900","REF-000901","REF-000902","REF-000903","REF-000910"]),
]

